[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567880454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113076#issuecomment-3567880454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113076","id":3567880454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UqYkG","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T12:05:41Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T12:16:17Z","body":"This change doesn't make any sense, it causes hash collisions with UID generation to generate duplicate UIDs, in particular this will be guaranteed to break if you create a file `foo.gd` in a project, and then move it where or rename it and then add a new `foo.gd`, that will get the same, already used, UID (especially since you removed the hash of the file contents from the generated value), worse it will generate the same UID for *all* `foo.gd` files in the project...\r\n\r\nIt also isn't completely random it's always the same for the same path and project *unless* that UID is already taken, because it sets the seed based on the path and then takes the first free UID\r\n\r\nAlso the UID will *not* be regenerated if the file is moved, only if it is a new file, or the UID information is deleted (for example by deleting the `.uid` file)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567880454/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567951678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113076#issuecomment-3567951678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113076","id":3567951678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Uqp8-","user":{"login":"KnifeXRage","id":172096350,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkH7Xg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172096350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage","html_url":"https://github.com/KnifeXRage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T13:22:24Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T13:22:24Z","body":"I know this was a bad idea but i am trying to make UID system that is constant for the specific file and doesn't causes collisions.\r\nI am working on that and update this PR after successfully implementing that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567951678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567953752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113076#issuecomment-3567953752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113076","id":3567953752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UqqdY","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T13:23:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T13:23:57Z","body":"What is this PR trying to solve though? This would only be relevant for cases where the UID is cleared *manually* and you want it to be the same even if you moved (but not renamed) the file","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567953752/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567974088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113076#issuecomment-3567974088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113076","id":3567974088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UqvbI","user":{"login":"KnifeXRage","id":172096350,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkH7Xg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172096350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage","html_url":"https://github.com/KnifeXRage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnifeXRage/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T13:47:29Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T13:47:29Z","body":"> What is this PR trying to solve though?\r\n\r\nThe main motive of this PR is to make resource identity independent of the file’s physical location, so that a resource keeps the same UID even if it is moved to another folder even outside of Godot editor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567974088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567974821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113076#issuecomment-3567974821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113076","id":3567974821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Uqvml","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T13:48:28Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T13:48:28Z","body":"Do you mean if you remove the file from the project and then add it back? So that the UID was cleared? The UID won't change when you move the file, that's 100% of the point of a UID","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567974821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3567992237","html_url":"https://