/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3647567959","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113076#issuecomment-3647567959","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113076","id":3647567959,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZaXhX","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-12T17:59:53Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T17:59:53Z","body":"This does not close the proposal, there is no associated UI for browsing the database. It can be added in a separate PR though.\r\n\r\nBut the database itself also has some problems.\r\n- This should be editor-only, with no core modifications. You can use EditorFileSystem for that.\r\n- The database file should not be located in the main directory, but in `.godot/editor`.\r\n  - Although that makes the file less persistent. I'm not sure how to solve that, but it should not be part of the project (and definitely not something that is exported).\r\n- The database only records the first path associated with the UID, while the proposal specifically says it should store the whole history (e.g. when the file is moved, both old and new path need to be recorded).\r\n- There seems to be some unnecessary information. No idea what `type` field is for, and the `created_on` is redundant, as the timestamp is enough.\r\n  - Note that this file is not meant to be read directly. It's going to be presented in the dedicated UI I mentioned above.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3647567959/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]